{"id":"451384","name":"菠菜西红柿鸡蛋汤","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"","cover":"images/451384/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2枚"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"食用盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：菠菜，西红柿，鸡蛋，葱姜末。","img":"images/451384/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠菜用刀去根，切段。","img":"images/451384/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中，用蛋抽打散。","img":"images/451384/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西红柿洗净之后切十字花刀，放在开水锅中烫一两分钟剥皮。","img":"images/451384/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"剥皮后切半后再切小块。","img":"images/451384/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/451384/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"爆香葱姜末。","img":"images/451384/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入菠菜翻炒。","img":"images/451384/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"菠菜变软之后倒入西红柿丁翻炒，加入食盐。","img":"images/451384/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入清水烧开。","img":"images/451384/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入酱油调味。","img":"images/451384/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅烧开后倒入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/451384/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"关火前倒入适量的鸡精即可。","img":"images/451384/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}